OL,3,GNEWSAHit-and-run driver spoke to woman
OL,4,Abefore knocking her down
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman was left seriously injured by a
OL,7,Fhit-and-run driver who spoke to her
OL,8,Fbefore knocking her down.
OL,10,FPolice Scotland said the suspect had a
OL,11,F"discussion" with the 35-year-old in
OL,12,FBaird Crescent, Cumbernauld, at about
OL,13,F18:55 on Saturday.
OL,15,FHe then drove off in a black Ford
OL,16,FFiesta before returning and striking
OL,17,Fthe pedestrian.
OL,19,FOfficers said the woman was taken to
OL,20,Fhospital for treatment.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
